  partName: Exhaust Manifold Bolt (5)
  description: The Exhaust Manifold Bolt (5) is a small, intricately shaped component
    positioned at the top-center-rear of the engine, fabricated from Material.001.
    As part of the exhaust manifold fastening system, it helps to maintain a secure
    connection between the exhaust manifold and engine, allowing for smooth engine
    operation. Interestingly, the bolt's complex shape and material properties enable
    it to resist corrosion and maintain its structural integrity, even when exposed
    to the harsh environment of the exhaust system.
